  ('399fbdd8-7c17-4157-acda-47cd49e10dd9',NULL,'Mujtaba ','2026-05-20','12:49:00','visit','DHA Visit','AS HABI SPORTS',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Drop 1 can of Aero Pro for sampling and review purpose','We are although sellig them V72, however they don''t have any good potential in cricket. Their most customer is of tennis, badminton or padel. \nAgainst which their review of Aero club ball wasn''t satisfactory.\nHowever, as per my commitment, we need to provide 1 can of Aero pro for their personal testing and feedback.','{}','2026-05-21 07:56:15.130397+00','2026-05-21 07:56:15.130397+00'),
